1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:04,230
Dear Black people, Juneteenth is our day.

2
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:08,670
You don't have to feel any kind of way about white people not being included in Juneteenth,

3
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:12,010
because they are included in Juneteenth as the descendants of enslavers.

4
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:14,710
But Juneteenth should be about unity.

5
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:15,950
Why?

6
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,090
This country is not about unity.

7
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,830
Juneteenth is an American holiday.

8
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:24,310
If you're not going to teach true history in American schools,

9
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:28,150
then don't come trying to take Black holidays and call them American holidays.

10
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:33,410
The point is, is that Black folks can be all right celebrating a day for Black folks

11
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:36,230
without feeling like we have to include other folks.

12
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:39,630
I don't see Christians spinning dreidels for Hanukkah ads.

13
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:40,810
Ba-dum-ba!

